      "role": "user",
      "content": "I see. It sounds like a lot of the skepticism comes from people who think the whole thing is just a distraction or a way to check boxes without real change. \n\nBut looking at how most major corporations are moving, it feels like the \"consensus\" is actually that DEI is just essential for modern business. Do you think the critics are actually making valid points about ROI, or are they mostly just trying to push back against social progress?",
